speech_separator.onnx is Conv-TasNet trained on Libri2Mix (sep_clean, 16 kHz) by Joris Cosentino
with Asteroid (https://huggingface.co/JorisCos/ConvTasNet_Libri2Mix_sepclean_16k), exported to ONNX
by https://huggingface.co/welcomyou/convtasnet-libri2mix-16k-onnx and quantized to 8-bit weights
for Earshield.

